      "updated": 1782870320776,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Two observability paths:\n  1. LLM Observability \u2014 app-level workflows/spans (host \u2192 Datadog direct)\n  2. LiteLLM integration \u2014 proxy metrics scraped by Agent \u2192 dashboard\n\nOptional: DEMO_MOCK=true (no LLM calls) | no LITELLM_PROXY_URL (direct Bedrock SDK)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Two observability paths:\n  1. LLM Observability \u2014 app-level workflows/spans (host \u2192 Datadog direct)\n  2. LiteLLM integration \u2014 proxy metrics scraped by Agent \u2192 dashboard\n\nOptional: DEMO_MOCK=true (no LLM calls) | no LITELLM_PROXY_URL (direct Bedrock SDK)",
